Optional developer assets are the complete publisher speech_tokenizer_v2.onnx
from FunAudioLLM/CosyVoice2-0.5B and campplus.onnx from
Soul-AILab/SoulX-Podcast-1.7B. Their model cards declare Apache-2.0; publisher
revisions, lengths and SHA256s are pinned separately. These are trained
REFERENCE components, not a complete SoulX checkpoint or speech-quality
certificate. Original/converted assets are kept only in ignored developer
directories or explicit user directories, never in Git, source archives or APK.

Host references AST-extract unchanged pinned torchaudio/librosa Python math
under the same test-only boundary documented in research/soulx/NOTICE.
No real-person voice reference, upstream example audio or model-specific
filter bank is bundled by this research module.
